<title>USA: Franklin Cty SDFC, Ky., won by Morgan Keegan.</title>
<headline>Franklin Cty SDFC, Ky., won by Morgan Keegan.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morgan Keegan said it won $4.250 million of Franklin Cty. SDFC, Ky., school building refunding revenue bonds, Series 1996 with a net interest cost of 4.84 percent.</p>
</text>
